{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, OctaneQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/octane-pacer/src/queuer/useQueuedState.ts#L35","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queuer/useQueuedState.ts:35"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Retains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"return-value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return value"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns [items, addItem, queue]."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"state-and-ownership","children":[{"type":"text","value":"State and ownership"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Items are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call during component rendering. The hook retains its utility across renders and runs cleanup when the component unmounts.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tselected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Pick"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuerState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"items\""},{"type":"text","value":"> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Pick"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuerState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"items\""},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"fn","children":[{"type":"text","value":"fn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/OctanePacerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"OctanePacerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/OctaneQueuerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"OctaneQueuerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"selector","children":[{"type":"text","value":"selector?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":"[], ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"item"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"position?"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runOnItemsChange?"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/OctaneQueuer.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"OctaneQueuer"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useQueuedState } from '@tanstack/octane-pacer'\n\n// During component rendering:\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = useQueuedState((item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\n// Read items during rendering.","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"see","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useQueuer"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"return-value","text":"Return value","level":2},{"id":"state-and-ownership","text":"State and ownership","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"fn","text":"fn","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"selector","text":"selector?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"see","text":"See","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, OctaneQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/useQueuedState.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/octane-pacer/src/queuer/useQueuedState.ts#L35)\n\nExposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them.\n\nRetains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue.\n\n## Return value\n\nReturns [items, addItem, queue].\n\n## State and ownership\n\nItems are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate.\n\nCall during component rendering. The hook retains its utility across renders and runs cleanup when the component unmounts.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` *extends* `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\> = `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### fn\n\n(`value`) => `void`\n\n### options?\n\n[`OctanePacerOptions`](../type-aliases/OctanePacerOptions.md)\\<[`OctaneQueuerOptions`](../interfaces/OctaneQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n## Returns\n\n\\[`TValue`[], (`item`, `position?`, `runOnItemsChange?`) => `boolean`, [`OctaneQueuer`](../interfaces/OctaneQueuer.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\]\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { useQueuedState } from '@tanstack/octane-pacer'\n\n// During component rendering:\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = useQueuedState((item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\n// Read items during rendering.\n```\n\n## See\n\nuseQueuer\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useQueuedState\ntitle: useQueuedState\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, OctaneQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/useQueuedState.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/octane-pacer/src/queuer/useQueuedState.ts#L35)\n\nExposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them.\n\nRetains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue.\n\n## Return value\n\nReturns [items, addItem, queue].\n\n## State and ownership\n\nItems are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate.\n\nCall during component rendering. The hook retains its utility across renders and runs cleanup when the component unmounts.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` *extends* `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\> = `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### fn\n\n(`value`) => `void`\n\n### options?\n\n[`OctanePacerOptions`](../type-aliases/OctanePacerOptions.md)\\<[`OctaneQueuerOptions`](../interfaces/OctaneQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n## Returns\n\n\\[`TValue`[], (`item`, `position?`, `runOnItemsChange?`) => `boolean`, [`OctaneQueuer`](../interfaces/OctaneQueuer.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\]\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { useQueuedState } from '@tanstack/octane-pacer'\n\n// During component rendering:\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = useQueuedState((item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\n// Read items during rendering.\n```\n\n## See\n\nuseQueuer\n"}
